0.0.8 (2026-10-26)
- fixed autoEquip equipping only 1 ring (notably for companions)
- added "Take All" keybind for containers (defaults to Q and R-Stick)
- fixed error after opening book (or other UI change) while looting containers
- fixed autoEquip preferring gauntlets to bracers even when they have lower armor rating
- fixed doubled sounds when picking up equipped item
- added button to move all visible non-equipped, non-favorite items into container
- API: added ways to modify how barter works:
  - ways to modify how items are priced and success chance and skill gain of barter offer
  - ways to get price of selling or buying an item
  - ways to manipulate what's currently queued to sell/buy
- bumped API version to 3

0.0.7 (2026-10-24)
- AR in tooltips and columns of companion's inventory show values as applied for companion
- added hand-to-hand to companion stats popup
- API: added 'observer' slot that can override who observer tooltip in inventory - used for companion inventory, mods can override if needed

0.0.6 (2026-10-23)
- fixed WindowManager:getWindow returning window control instead of handler
- fixed restocking stacks decreasing if not bough-out fully
- added steal chance column while pickpocketing (can be disabled)
- added button that shows companion stats
- show armor rating on companion inventory
- API version bumped to 2
- Major API update to allow modifying parts of the windows - read API.md for details
- added logger, by default logs errors only

0.0.5 (2026-10-21)
- basic restore of opened category
- fixed wrong item counts when bartering or picking up items in grid mode

0.0.4 (2026-10-19)
- fixed OnPCEquip not resetting on drop/transfer when holding ALT
- added option to show grid with horizontal scroll (on by default)
- API: added method to get window handler
- toxicology mod: update inventory when poison is applied
- crafting framework mod: added craft quality to tooltips

0.0.3 (2026-10-18)
- fixed merchants refusing to sell
- ported OnPCEquip fix from base IE
- added example mini-mod that changes weapon type for katars and knuckledusters
- API: added registerRowBadge - registers providers for custom badges
- API: registered data modifiers are now called in registration order, not reversed
- API: swapped names of the onPickup/onUse as their usage is actually swapped from naming semantics
- added toxicology interop mod - shows poison badge and coating in tooltip

0.0.2 (2026-10-17)
- API: IER_Window_Opened event with window details
- API: added getDraggingObject
- added example mini-mod that adds Crafting Framework's button to IER

0.0.1 (2026-10-16)
- first public release 